  "_comment": "What each file under docs/img shows of this integration's UI, and the fingerprints of those sources when it was recorded. scripts/media.py checks it (the docs unit tests run it) and stamps it; its docstring says how to record again. `files` in a group is a regex on the path under docs/img.",
